NewsClaw / 新闻爪
===================

NewsClaw is an independent, local-only news-domain adaptation of
OpenBiliClaw. It does not require the upstream project at runtime.

Substantial portions of the architecture, interaction design, and source code
are derived from OpenBiliClaw:

  https://github.com/whiteguo233/OpenBiliClaw

Those portions remain available under the MIT License included in LICENSE:

  Copyright (c) 2026 OpenBiliClaw Contributors

The browser and DSH clients may also contain code adapted from
dsh-openbiliclaw, whose BSD-3-Clause notice is retained with that client.

News articles, publisher names, publisher marks, and third-party API data are
not covered by the software licenses. NewsClaw stores provenance and links to
the original publisher. The default build is for the owner's personal,
non-commercial, local use only.
